  description: Unicorns are noble fae beasts of medium size, roughly the size of
    a large horse, with a flowing mane and a long tail ending in a tuft of hair.
    They have no wings, but gallop with smooth, four-legged movement. They do not
    speak in words; instead they produce soft animalistic sounds - snorts, whinnies,
    and quiet neighs - though many claim their meaning can be felt in the mind.
